um and at  a White House dinner it is fascinating  watching U.S officials trying hard not  to talk about what they feel are the  malign intentions of China and Russia  but they know that to do so is to  suggest that African nations are somehow  naive and unaware of the consequences of  their own strategic priorities  Al Jazeera Washington
 

